==Battleground==
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Emperor Santa]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Pigge Back]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**1 [[Lord Enma]] spawns.
**3 [[Christmas D.|Christmas Ds]] spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level isn't super hard but if you need help on this level, here is a basic strategy;

Lineup - 3-4 meatshields, any anti-red units that you have (a rusher like [[Cutter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cutter Cat]] is great for this and a no-gacha alternative is [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cat]]), [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] and fill the rest with high DPS cats like [[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Elemental Duelist Cat]] and things that can interrupt Nyandam's attack like [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Pirate Cat]] and [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Bean Cats]].

Try and cancel Dark Emperor Santa's attack as much as possible. Dark Emperor Santa will freeze ALL your cats in his range for only 13 frames less than his time between attacks.

